# Responsibilities: Preserve workflow line endings at the submission repository root.
# Implementation: Application/LFS/archive attributes live in SystemCode so subtree releases
# use the same rules as local development and full-repository checkouts.
# Related Modules: .github/workflows/deploy.yml; SystemCode/.gitattributes.
# Declaration Index: None.
# Variable Index: text/eol keep GitHub Actions YAML in LF format.
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
